OL,3,GNEWSABid to reduce council's #45m
OL,4,Aschool transport bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans are under way to reduce a county
OL,7,Fcouncil's #45m annual school transport
OL,8,Fbill in the face of growing demand.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire County Council said
OL,11,Fabout #3,600 per child was being spent
OL,12,Fon support to get them to school or
OL,13,Fanother place of education.
OL,15,FThe authority has a legal duty to
OL,16,Fprovide home-to-school transport for
OL,17,Feligible children.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
